</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8f9877d4-ddc9-11f1-b424-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T155719Z-652015653-RC23LOADBZX1-RTRMADP-3-USA-POLAND.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8f9877d4-ddc9-11f1-b424-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T155719Z-652015653-RC23LOADBZX1-RTRMADP-3-USA-POLAND.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3da2ba66-ddc9-11f1-a0e7-d9e11bf78434</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:17:22 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>'Welcome Home': Peru awaits Pope Leo's emotional 'homecoming'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/welcome-home-peru-awaits-pope-leo-s-emotional-homecoming</link><description>
Pope Leo will wrap ​up his visit to Argentina on Wednesday during his 12-day South America tour, with a final event expected to draw millions, before traveling to Peru in an emotional homecoming for the first Peruvian citizen to lead the Catholic Church.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d11fc4ac-ddc2-11f1-966c-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-121133-121335-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d11fc4ac-ddc2-11f1-966c-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-121133-121335-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d6582a54-ddc2-11f1-9b30-cd4db83ef990</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:53:43 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Pope Leo to end Argentina tour with outdoor mass before Peru 'homecoming'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261111-pope-leo-to-end-argentina-tour-with-large-outdoor-mass-before-emotional-peru-homecoming</link><description>
Pope Leo will conclude his three-day visit to Argentina Wednesday with an outdoor mass expected to draw millions before continuing his tour of South America by travelling to Peru, where he once served as a missionary. The pontiff plans to deliver a speech in front of Peruvian President Keiko Fujimori, whose election earlier this year was marred ‌by fraud accusations and vote-counting delays.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/00e3970e-dcf1-11f1-a046-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T025534Z-1494237382-RC2KKOA1WTJ1-RTRMADP-3-POPE-LATAM-ARGENTINA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/00e3970e-dcf1-11f1-a046-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T025534Z-1494237382-RC2KKOA1WTJ1-RTRMADP-3-POPE-LATAM-ARGENTINA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a4039908-ddb8-11f1-8a39-d70283fad2d7</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:50:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/00e3970e-dcf1-11f1-a046-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T025534Z-1494237382-RC2KKOA1WTJ1-RTRMADP-3-POPE-LATAM-ARGENTINA.jpg">© Yara Nardi, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Nayib Bukele says Salvadoran troops destroyed gang HQ in Haiti</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/nayib-bukele-says-salvadoran-troops-destroyed-gang-hq-in-haiti</link><description>
President Nayib Bukele said Tuesday that Salvadoran troops deployed to Haiti had destroyed the headquarters of one of the Caribbean nation's most powerful gangs.Bukele has deployed more than 2,000 soldiers to Haiti since late October, after four Salvadoran troops went missing in the country.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/713ff9f8-ddb3-11f1-9a34-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-102134-102304-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/713ff9f8-ddb3-11f1-9a34-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-102134-102304-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7eb1c79c-ddb3-11f1-be66-4752e6fd9f18</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:58:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>House Republicans quash effort to impeach Defense Secretary Hegseth</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/house-republicans-quash-effort-to-impeach-defense-secretary-hegseth</link><description>
Rochelle Ferguson Bouyahi, our international affairs editor, has more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d94bf444-ddb2-11f1-ad88-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-100134-100727-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d94bf444-ddb2-11f1-ad88-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-100134-100727-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">de61a2c6-ddb2-11f1-9d49-3f1199c0e845</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:55:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>UK authorities arrest US soldier suspected of spying for Russia</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/uk-authorities-arrests-us-soldier-suspected-of-spying-for-russia</link><description>
A member of the US army suspected of spying for Russia was arrested in Britain on Tuesday, London police said, following an investigation with support from the American military and law enforcement.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/19b8116e-ddb0-11f1-9db5-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-080643-080817-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/19b8116e-ddb0-11f1-9db5-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-080643-080817-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">2338c21a-ddb0-11f1-97dc-21d1d5ea5b39</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:41:06 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Want to live on the moon? NASA opens recruitment for Artemis programme</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/want-to-live-moon-nasa-opens-recruitment-for-artemis-programme</link><description>
NASA is expanding its astronaut corps for the first time in two years. As the US space agency grows its Artemis programme, recruitment is in progress for a brand-new class of space explorers who will train to "live and work beyond Earth". 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6d31ad6c-dda8-11f1-bfaf-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26146646568090.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6d31ad6c-dda8-11f1-bfaf-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26146646568090.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">67860e32-dda1-11f1-b5a1-fb70a7eee328</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:42:21 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/6d31ad6c-dda8-11f1-bfaf-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26146646568090.jpg">NASA via AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US House blocks bid to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261111-us-house-blocks-bid-to-impeach-defense-secretary-pete-hegseth</link><description>
The US House of Representatives turned aside a resolution to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday, halting an effort to remove the Pentagon chief for his conduct in office and his handling of the war in Iran. Story by Jack Pownall.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/97b5d9da-dda0-11f1-b235-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-080220-080340-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/97b5d9da-dda0-11f1-b235-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20261111-080220-080340-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9ce12284-dda0-11f1-bae4-a5913573bf31</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:33:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Haiti's PM praises Bukele after Salvadoran troops help destroy gang headquarters</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261111-haiti-pm-bukele-salvadoran-troops-gang-headquarters</link><description>
Haitian Prime Minister Alix Didier Fils-Aimé praised Salvadoran President Nayib Bukele on Tuesday after Salvadoran troops aided in the destruction a suspected gang leader’s home near Port-au-Prince. Bukele’s deployment of more than 2,000 soldiers following four Salvadoran troops’ disappearance has raised concerns over rules of engagement and coordination with a UN-backed force combating Haiti’s gangs.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f6b96226-dd6e-11f1-8550-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26304751949491.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f6b96226-dd6e-11f1-8550-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26304751949491.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a4fda8f2-dd5a-11f1-ad69-e1ffb160b1e3</guid><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:41:43 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f6b96226-dd6e-11f1-8550-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26304751949491.jpg">© Odelyn Joseph, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Trump ally Jim Jordan elected House Republican leader after midterm defeat</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-trump-jim-jordan-elected-house-republican-leader-midterm-defeat</link><description>
Congressman Jim Jordan, a hardline ally of President Donald Trump, was elected House Republican leader on Tuesday, defeating Steve Scalise 106-73 in a secret ballot, US media reported. He replaces Mike Johnson after Republicans lost both chambers of Congress in last week’s midterm elections and will lead the party’s opposition.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/06f33884-dd55-11f1-8edc-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26314801252851.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/06f33884-dd55-11f1-8edc-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26314801252851.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5208fbca-dd54-11f1-8f9a-4170e025bec9</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:42:42 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/06f33884-dd55-11f1-8edc-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26314801252851.jpg">© Jacquelyn Martin, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>US charges three 'Iranian operatives' over terror plot at UK Fairford airbase</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-us-iranian-operatives-raf-fairford-terror-plot</link><description>
The US Justice Department on Tuesday charged three men it described as Iranian operatives over an alleged September terrorist plot at Britain's RAF Fairford airbase in England. Prosecutors said one suspect directed individuals to drive vans, some carrying fuel barrels, to the base, which housed US military aircraft and personnel.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/171ed8f2-bbb4-11f1-8d96-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/57dc9c551e76668bc449a277499265d5ddae0db3.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/171ed8f2-bbb4-11f1-8d96-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/57dc9c551e76668bc449a277499265d5ddae0db3.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">fc967438-dd53-11f1-b5da-63277a954c91</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 22:26:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/171ed8f2-bbb4-11f1-8d96-8f3418d01115/w:1024/p:16x9/57dc9c551e76668bc449a277499265d5ddae0db3.jpg">© Ben Stanstall, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>Filming amongst body bags: New Colombian president’s comms campaign sparks backlash</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-filming-amongst-body-bags-new-colombian-president-s-comms-campaign-sparks-backlash</link><description>
Since taking office in August, new far-right Colombian president Abelardo de la Espriella has shared video after video promoting his security forces – especially operations they’ve carried out against armed groups. In some, De la Espriella speaks standing among body bags. Others feature prisoners or look like they were taken from an action film. However, there’s been growing outcry about his social media glorification of repressive policies.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/fea3bb90-d877-11f1-a21b-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/1-Colombie-pst-sacs-mortuaires-25octobre-copie.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/fea3bb90-d877-11f1-a21b-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/1-Colombie-pst-sacs-mortuaires-25octobre-copie.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9191d88a-dcfe-11f1-92b5-55e0ae4d37c1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:18:30 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/fea3bb90-d877-11f1-a21b-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/1-Colombie-pst-sacs-mortuaires-25octobre-copie.png">© Abdelaespriella via X</source><dc:creator>The FRANCE 24 Observers</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US Pentagon chief Pete Hegseth calls impeachment moves 'a farce'</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-impeachment-moves-a-farce</link><description>
US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday, November 10, called an effort to impeach him over ​abuse of power in the Iran war a farce and sabotage that plays into the hands of adversaries. FRANCE 24's International Affairs Commentator Douglas Herbert has more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7e5c890c-dd28-11f1-a6c4-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-e7e447f9.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7e5c890c-dd28-11f1-a6c4-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-e7e447f9.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">4e4469e2-dd1e-11f1-8763-8dfd77cb057f</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:43:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Who exactly is Pete Hegseth, the Pentagon chief facing an impeachment bid?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-who-exactly-is-pete-hegseth-the-pentagon-chief-facing-an-impeachment-bid</link><description>
US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday dismissed the impeachment effort against him as "a political spectacle". He made the comments a day after Republican Thomas Massie launched a bid to impeach him over his handling of the unpopular war in Iran and other actions. But who is Pete Hegseth? A former Fox News host and military veteran, he has become one of the most prominent figures in the Trump administration.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a5d672ce-dd21-11f1-b255-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T144512Z-1883253732-RC22LOA55V22-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a5d672ce-dd21-11f1-b255-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T144512Z-1883253732-RC22LOA55V22-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">3464cc22-dd20-11f1-85aa-dfe1b3e15755</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:41:45 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Pope Leo XIV visits Argentina in second leg of Latin American tour</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-pope-leo-xiv-visits-argentina-in-second-leg-of-latin-american-tour</link><description>
Pope Leo XIV visited Argentina on the second leg of his South American tour, following a stop in Uruguay. During his visit, he celebrated public Masses, met with the faithful and held talks with religious and government leaders. Peru is the final stop on the pontiff's tour.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8dffda2c-dd22-11f1-bed1-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-f018111e.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8dffda2c-dd22-11f1-bed1-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-f018111e.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d139a9a0-dd20-11f1-9324-c989cf664976</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:38:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>REPLAY: Pentagon chief Hegseth holds news briefing amid impeachment push</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-replay-pentagon-chief-hegseth-holds-news-briefing-amid-impeachment-push</link><description>
US ​Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth on Tuesday called ​moves to impeach him over abuse of power in the Iran war a "farce" that ​would ‌fail. Hegseth made the comment ⁠at a news conference – his first since May – a day after US Representative ‌Thomas Massie, a Kentucky Republican, introduced eight ⁠articles of impeachment against him. Watch our replay.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a4ec11da-dd0c-11f1-9edd-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T133812Z-839619578-RC21LOABPNYD-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a4ec11da-dd0c-11f1-9edd-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T133812Z-839619578-RC21LOABPNYD-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c09d19c2-dd22-11f1-9bd8-e5cd8f2f1a59</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:23:38 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>House Republicans block Hegseth impeachment bid, handing Trump a win</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-live-pentagon-chief-pete-hegseth-calls-move-to-impeach-him-a-farce</link><description>
Republicans in the US House on Tuesday blocked an effort to impeach Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth over the Iran war, handing President Donald Trump a victory days after his party’s midterm defeat. Hegseth dismissed the move as a “farce” and “political spectacle”, while Trump praised his performance as “A plus”.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a4ec11da-dd0c-11f1-9edd-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T133812Z-839619578-RC21LOABPNYD-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a4ec11da-dd0c-11f1-9edd-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T133812Z-839619578-RC21LOABPNYD-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">38b95690-dd0b-11f1-b081-fb8708c37a00</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 13:32:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/a4ec11da-dd0c-11f1-9edd-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T133812Z-839619578-RC21LOABPNYD-RTRMADP-3-USA-HEGSETH.jpg">© Evelyn Hockstein, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>California voters reject measure to tax the wealth of billionaires</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-california-voters-reject-measure-to-tax-the-wealth-of-billionaires</link><description>
California voters have rejected a first-in-the-nation tax on the net worth of billionaires following a contentious ballot fight that generated huge spending by some prominent tech leaders eager to stop their taxes from going up. The measure would have imposed a one-time 5% tax on the wealth of Californians whose net worth exceeds $1 billion. FRANCE 24's correspondent in Los Angeles Loic Pialat has more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/73384700-dcf6-11f1-ad84-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-9ee8e9dd.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/73384700-dcf6-11f1-ad84-5f54d898a954/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-9ee8e9dd.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b98f79e0-dcf5-11f1-8007-fbcd23925f41</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:20:09 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Paraguayan protesters are back on the streets despite the removal of President</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-paraguayan-protesters-are-back-on-the-streets-despite-the-removal-of-president</link><description>
A banking crisis that saw the president of Paraguay impeached Friday, November 6, continues to rock the country with protesters back on the streets. The Ueno Bank started as a digital first bank, attracting many low income customers, quickly growing to become a major bank in charge of state pensions and holding the accounts of several government institutions before having its accounts frozen by the central bank due to solvency concerns.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2663732a-dcef-11f1-8efc-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0f7c8b5f.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2663732a-dcef-11f1-8efc-3f371022a770/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0f7c8b5f.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">06e0cb2c-dcec-11f1-a4c8-4d3815f82905</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:53:38 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Peru gets ready to welcome Pope Leo XIV on his South America tour</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-peru-gets-ready-to-welcome-pope-leo-xiv-on-his-south-america-tour</link><description>
Pope Leo XIV continued his South American tour on Wednesday, November 11, with a visit to Peru, after stops in Uruguay and Argentina. The American-born pontiff lived in Peru for several years and even became a Peruvian citizen. Ahead of his arrival, the country unveiled a giant statue in his honour.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/00e3970e-dcf1-11f1-a046-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T025534Z-1494237382-RC2KKOA1WTJ1-RTRMADP-3-POPE-LATAM-ARGENTINA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/00e3970e-dcf1-11f1-a046-29048b396e03/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-10T025534Z-1494237382-RC2KKOA1WTJ1-RTRMADP-3-POPE-LATAM-ARGENTINA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">044bd8e6-dcee-11f1-9eb4-d9892df74bcc</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:48:57 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US Republican Thomas Massie launches bid to impeach Pete Hegseth</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261110-us-republican-thomas-massie-launches-bid-to-impeach-pete-hegseth</link><description>
