</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c4c66f20-dcf1-11f1-acb2-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0923e3a2.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c4c66f20-dcf1-11f1-acb2-f71d22e7fea9/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-0923e3a2.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">25179716-dceb-11f1-9afd-c7c00b2fd90f</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:42:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Americas</category><title>California voters reject proposed one-time tax on billionaires' wealth</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261110-california-voters-reject-proposed-one-time-tax-on-billionaires-wealth</link><description>
