</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bfd386b6-dc5a-11f1-81dc-d18c5759e759/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-1cc6b77f.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bfd386b6-dc5a-11f1-81dc-d18c5759e759/w:1024/p:16x9/capture-1cc6b77f.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e5099264-dc59-11f1-8c4e-13773f08eafa</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 16:47:19 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Nvidia CEO probed over alleged China spy: Who exactly is Jensen Huang?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261109-nvidia-ceo-probed-over-alleged-china-spy-who-exactly-is-jensen-huang</link><description>
